\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">: </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">신청원을 작성하여 소속 학부장을 경유</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">(</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">날인</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">)</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">한 후 연계전공 이수 포기</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">(</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">변경</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">)</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">원을 창업교육센터에 제출</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">.</span></p><p style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\"></span>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">다</span></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">. </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">신청장소 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">: </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">창업교육센터 행정실 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">(</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">그린에너지관 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">202</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">호</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">)</span></p><p style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\"></span>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">라</span></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">. </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">신청서류 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">: </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">연계전공 포기</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">(</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">변경</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">)</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">신청서 및 성적증명서</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">(</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">원본</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">) </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">각 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">1</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">부</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">._붙임참고</span></p><p style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\"></span>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">마</span></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">. </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">참고사항</span></p><p style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\"></span>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\" lang=\"EN-US\"></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">1) </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">연계전공을 포기한 경우 기 취득한 과목 중 주전공 교과목이 아닌 참여 전공 교과목의 이수학점은 일반선택학점으로 인정하며</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">, </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">복수전공 또는 부전공으로 변경하는 경우에는 해당 전공학점으로 인정</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">.</span></p><p style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\"></span>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\" lang=\"EN-US\"></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">2) </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">졸업 대상자 중에서 연계전공 이수자로 선발되었으나</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">, </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">이수가 불가능할 경우에는 반드시 이수포기 신청을 하여야 합니다</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">.</span></span></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
